Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies\N♪ 女士们 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonlight\N♪ 皎洁月光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Starlite\N♪ 璀璨星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All night\N♪ 彻夜相伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonlight\N♪ 皎洁月光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.80,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Starlight\N♪ 璀璨星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All night\N♪ 彻夜相伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dance with me\N♪ 来吧，与我共舞 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna run away with me, I know a galaxy\N♪ 若你想与我私奔 我知道一个星系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can take you for a ride\N♪ 我能带你去那里遨游兜风 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a premonition that we fell into a rhythm\N♪ 预感我们将沉浸于这节奏 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the music don't stop for life\N♪ 音乐不息 生命不止 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in my eyes\N♪ 天际璀璨 映于我眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:00:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way I like\N♪ 闪耀如我所愿 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:01:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling like you need a little bit of company\N♪ 若你此刻需要陪伴 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You met me at the perfect time\N♪ 你我在最完美的时间相遇 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me, I want you, baby\N♪ 你渴望我 我亦需要你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.26,0:01:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My sugarboo, I'm levitating\N♪ 我的甜心 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Milky Way, we're renegading\N♪ 我们将一同逃离银河系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you, moonlight, you're my starlight\N♪ 你是我的月光 独一无二的星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you all night, come on, dance with me\N♪ 我整夜都需要你 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You, moonlight, you're my starlight\N♪ 你是我的月光 独一无二的星光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you all night, come on, dance with me\N♪ 我整夜都需要你 来与我共舞吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm levitating\N♪ 我飘飘欲仙 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that you're for me, I feel it in our energy\N♪ 我坚信你属于我 能量已诉说明晰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see us written in the stars\N♪ 我们的名字刻于星辰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.31,0:01:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go wherever, so let's do it now or never\N♪ 我们可以去任何地方 此刻莫再犹豫 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.29,0:01:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, nothing's ever, ever too far\N♪ 亲爱的 没有什么是遥不可及 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Glitter in the sky, glitter in our eyes\N♪ 天际璀璨 映于你我双眸 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining just the way we are\N♪ 闪耀如我们本真模样 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're forever every time we get together\N♪ 每次相聚都恍若永恒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, let's get lost on Mars\N♪ 但无论如何 让我们在火星恣意流浪 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me, I want you, baby\N♪ 你渴望我 我亦需要你 ♪
